severity-ceiling: high
context-window: 0
tags: static
remediation: Remove the literal from source and rotate the credential it names.
  A client secret, bearer token or credential in source is a long-lived credential and
  must be treated as compromised once committed; issue it at runtime instead.
references: CWE-798

# The UNQUOTED half of the matrix, and the one this ticket exists for: a
# .env / shell / Dockerfile ENV / compose / CI `KEY=value` line with no
# quotes at all.  See the header for why this record - and only this record -
# is anchored to line-start assignment syntax.
# A line anchor cannot distinguish config from JS/TS object properties or
# default arguments. Scope this record away from those source forms, keeping
# extensionless / custom-named configuration readable and quoted literals
# covered by the generic rules. These are language globs, never site paths.
id: SAST-SEC-ENV_ASSIGNMENT-01
title: Hardcoded credential in an unquoted assignment
exclude-files: *.js
exclude-files: *.jsx
exclude-files: *.[cm]js
exclude-files: *.ts
exclude-files: *.tsx
exclude-files: *.[cm]ts
severity: high
confidence: medium
cwe: CWE-798
owasp: A07:2025
pattern: ^[[:space:]]*(-[[:space:]]+)?([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*:[[:space:]]+)?(([Ee][Xx][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]|ENV|ARG|[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Oo][Nn][Ll][Yy]|[Dd][Ee][Cc][Ll][Aa][Rr][Ee]|[Ll][Oo][Cc][Aa][Ll])[[:space:]]+)?[A-Za-z0-9_-]*(([Pp][Aa][Ss][Ss]([Ww]([Oo][Rr])?[Dd]|[Pp][Hh][Rr][Aa][Ss][Ee])|[Pp][Ww][Dd])|([Aa][Pp][Ii]|[Aa][Cc][Cc][Ee][Ss][Ss])[_-]?[Kk][Ee][Yy]|([Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]|[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]))[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[\"']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*[^\"'`[:space:]()<>{};,/~!$%@.=:-][^\"'`[:space:]()<>{};,]{5,}([[:space:]]|$)
