remediation: Replace the default password with a generated one supplied at runtime; a
  well-known default is guessable whether or not the file is ever leaked.
references: CWE-1392

# The NON-PRODUCTION half of the keyword records above.  A credential-shaped
# literal in a test, documentation, example or CI file is overwhelmingly a
# fixture value, a documented placeholder or an ephemeral CI service password,
# so the four keyword records and SAST-SEC-DEFAULT_PASSWORD-01 exclude exactly
# these paths and this record reports the same shapes there at `low`: still
# visible, never presented as a critical vulnerability.  Its `files:` list is
# byte-identical to their non-production `exclude-files:` list, so each path is
# claimed by exactly one side (tests/suites/sast-secrets-forms.sh section F).
# The provider-shaped records (AWS key, private key, JWT) keep reporting on
# these paths at full severity: a real key pasted into a test is still a key.
# Its pattern is the union of the four keyword patterns, verbatim, and it
# carries their guards; the digit guard is scoped to the secret, token and
# API-key names as on those records, so a letters-only fixture password, and
# a well-known default one, still show here.
id: SAST-SEC-NONPROD_CREDENTIAL-01
title: Credential-shaped literal in a test, documentation, example or CI file
severity: low
confidence: medium
cwe: CWE-798
owasp: A07:2025
pattern: ([A-Za-z0-9_-]*([Pp][Aa][Ss][Ss]([Ww]([Oo][Rr])?[Dd]|[Pp][Hh][Rr][Aa][Ss][Ee])|[Pp][Ww][Dd])[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[\"']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*[\"'`][^\"'`[:space:]]{6,}[\"'`]|[A-Za-z0-9_-]*([Aa][Pp][Ii]|[Aa][Cc][Cc][Ee][Ss][Ss])[_-]?[Kk][Ee][Yy][A-Za-z0-9_-]*[\"']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*[\"'`][^\"'`[:space:]]{16,}[\"'`]|[A-Za-z0-9_-]*([Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]|[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll])[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[\"']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*[\"'`][^\"'`[:space:]]{8,}[\"'`]|^[[:space:]]*(-[[:space:]]+)?([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*:[[:space:]]+)?(([Ee][Xx][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]|ENV|ARG|[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Oo][Nn][Ll][Yy]|[Dd][Ee][Cc][Ll][Aa][Rr][Ee]|[Ll][Oo][Cc][Aa][Ll])[[:space:]]+)?[A-Za-z0-9_-]*(([Pp][Aa][Ss][Ss]([Ww]([Oo][Rr])?[Dd]|[Pp][Hh][Rr][Aa][Ss][Ee])|[Pp][Ww][Dd])|([Aa][Pp][Ii]|[Aa][Cc][Cc][Ee][Ss][Ss])[_-]?[Kk][Ee][Yy]|([Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]|[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]))[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[\"']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*[^\"'`[:space:]()<>{};,/~!$%@.=:-][^\"'`[:space:]()<>{};,]{5,}([[:space:]]|$))
