match-deny: [a-z0-9](File|Path|Dir|Url|Uri|Name|Id|Env|Var|Hash|Digest|Regex|Pattern|Policy|Length|Min|Max|Enabled|Disabled|Required|Optional|Field|Header|Param|Prompt|Label|Title|Text|Message|Type|Format|Ttl|Expiry|Expires|Rotation|Suffix|Prefix|Count|Size|Limit|Algo|Algorithm|Encoding|Mask|Hint|Reset|Confirm|Attempts|Lockout|Column|Table|Schema|Version|Strength|Score|Age|History|Region|Zone|Mtime|Time|Date|Timestamp|At)["'`]?[[:space:]]*[:=]
