severity-ceiling: low
context-window: 0
tags: static
remediation: Confirm the literal is a fixture or placeholder value rather than a real credential.
  If it is real, rotate it and replace it with a placeholder or a value generated at test time;
  a credential committed to a test, README or CI file is committed in git history like any other.
references: CWE-798
